**Goal Model – Multi‑Robot Resource Delivery**

| **Name** | **Text** | **Runtime** | **Goal Type** | **Relation** |
|----------|-----------|-------------|---------------|--------------|
| **G1** | Fulfil resource request (collect + deliver) | `;` | Perform | AND |
| **G2** | Collect resources from storages | `;` | Perform | AND |
| **G3** | Deliver resources to destination | `;` | Perform | AND |
| **G2.1** | Determine order of storages (waiting + path) | `-` | Query | AND |
| **G2.2** | Request resource from storage | `-` | Perform | AND |
| **G2.3** | Wait for retrieval | `-` | Perform | AND |
| **G2.4** | Go to recharge station & assign mission to another robot | `-` | Perform | AND |
| **G3.1** | Transport resources to destination | `-` | Perform | AND |
| **G3.2** | Return resource to checkpoint & assign remaining task | `-` | Perform | AND |
| **G3.3** | Alert sector manager on failure | `-` | Perform | AND |

