### Task Model

| **Name** | **Text** | **Relation** | **Location** | **Number of Robots** |
|----------|-----------|--------------|--------------|------------------------|
| **AT1** | Determine order of storages (waiting + path) | AND | Planning area | 1 |
| **AT2** | Request resource from storage | AND | Storage | 1 |
| **AT3** | Wait for retrieval | AND | Storage | 1 |
| **AT4** | Go to recharge station | AND | Recharge station | 1 |
| **AT5** | Assign mission to another robot | AND | Control centre | 1 |
| **AT6** | Transport resources to destination | AND | Destination | 1 |
